      "SPI.begin(PIN_SCK, -1, PIN_MOSI, PIN_CS);",
      "tft.init(240, 240, SPI_MODE0);",
      "tft.setRotation(2);",
      "tft.setSPISpeed(10000000);"
    ],
    "operations": [
      "tft.fillScreen(ST77XX_BLACK);",
      "tft.setCursor(10, 10); tft.setTextColor(ST77XX_WHITE); tft.setTextSize(2); tft.print(\"Hello\");"
    ],
    "example_refs": [
      "supplements/sources/code/Adafruit-ST7735-Library/examples/graphicstest_st7789/graphicstest_st7789.ino"
    ],
    "constraints": [
      "PIN_*由工程分配，不直接照抄例程Arduino引脚。",
      "Adafruit 1.12.0的240×240 rotation 0引入80行偏移；rotation 2使用零偏移和MADCTL RGB，作为本地模拟配置选择。",
      "10MHz为本地保守起始设置，并非模型或采购屏的额定最高频率。",
      "未进行编译/仿真；零偏移策略仅由两端源码分析得出。",
      "ST7735/ST7789库的library.properties另外声明Adafruit seesaw Library与SD；由包管理器按原始清单解析，不把本地列出的三个直接版本当成完整依赖锁。"
    ],
